{"id":903,"slug":"903-implement-simple-pub-sub-system-cho-micro-frontends","category":"JavaScript","subcategory":"Coding Challenge","level":"advanced","question_vi":"Implement simple pub/sub system cho micro-frontends?","question_en":"Implement a simple pub/sub system for micro-frontends.","answer_vi":"Pub/sub bus cho phép micro-frontends communicate mà không cần direct coupling.\n\n```js\nconst bus = {\n  subs: {},\n  subscribe(event, fn) {\n    (this.subs[event] ||= []).push(fn);\n    return () => { this.subs[event] = this.subs[event].filter(f => f !== fn); };\n  },\n  publish(event, data) { this.subs[event]?.forEach(fn => fn(data)); }\n};\n```\n\nDùng cho cross-app communication. Thêm: typed events, wildcard, once listener.","answer_en":"A pub/sub bus lets micro-frontends talk to each other without coupling directly.\n\n```js\nconst bus = {\n  subs: {},\n  subscribe(event, fn) {\n    (this.subs[event] ||= []).push(fn);\n    return () => { this.subs[event] = this.subs[event].filter(f => f !== fn); };\n  },\n  publish(event, data) { this.subs[event]?.forEach(fn => fn(data)); }\n};\n```\n\nUsed for cross-app communication. Worth adding: typed events, wildcards, one-time listeners.","answer_html_vi":"<p>Pub/sub bus cho phép micro-frontends communicate mà không cần direct coupling.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const bus = {\n  subs: {},\n  subscribe(event, fn) {\n    (this.subs[event] ||= []).push(fn);\n    return () =&gt; { this.subs[event] = this.subs[event].filter(f =&gt; f !== fn); };\n  },\n  publish(event, data) { this.subs[event]?.forEach(fn =&gt; fn(data)); }\n};\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> bus = {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">subs</span>: {},\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">subscribe</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">event, fn</span>) {\n    (<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">subs</span>[event] ||= []).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">push</span>(fn);\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">subs</span>[event] = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">subs</span>[event].<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">filter</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">f</span> =&gt;</span> f !== fn); };\n  },\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">publish</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">event, data</span>) { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">subs</span>[event]?.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">forEach</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">fn</span> =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fn</span>(data)); }\n};</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Dùng cho cross-app communication.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Thêm: typed events, wildcard, once listener.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p>A pub/sub bus lets micro-frontends talk to each other without coupling directly.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const bus = {\n  subs: {},\n  subscribe(event, fn) {\n    (this.subs[event] ||= []).push(fn);\n    return () =&gt; { this.subs[event] = this.subs[event].filter(f =&gt; f !== fn); };\n  },\n  publish(event, data) { this.subs[event]?.forEach(fn =&gt; fn(data)); }\n};\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> bus = {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">subs</span>: {},\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">subscribe</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">event, fn</span>) {\n    (<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">subs</span>[event] ||= []).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">push</span>(fn);\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">subs</span>[event] = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">subs</span>[event].<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">filter</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">f</span> =&gt;</span> f !== fn); };\n  },\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">publish</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">event, data</span>) { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">subs</span>[event]?.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">forEach</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">fn</span> =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fn</span>(data)); }\n};</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Used for cross-app communication.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Worth adding: typed events, wildcards, one-time listeners.</p>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/201-su-khac-biet-giua-var-let-va-const-la-gi","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa var, let và const là gì?"},{"url":"/q/202-javascript-co-nhung-kieu-du-lieu-nguyen-thuy-primitive-types-nao","title":"JavaScript có những kiểu dữ liệu nguyên thuỷ (primitive types) nào?"},{"url":"/q/205-symbol-trong-javascript-la-gi-va-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"Symbol trong JavaScript là gì và dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/207-toan-tu-va-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"Toán tử == và === khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/208-type-coercion-ep-kieu-tu-dong-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Type coercion (ép kiểu tự động) trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/209-truthy-va-falsy-values-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Truthy và falsy values trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/210-nan-la-gi-tai-sao-nan-nan","title":"NaN là gì? Tại sao NaN !== NaN?"},{"url":"/q/211-hoisting-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Hoisting trong JavaScript là gì?"}]}